DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18849::$$$message_0145_0000_0000$$$::I suddenly feel like going to the forest ruins![lr]::
18850::$$$message_0145_0000_0001$$$::I have an awful feeling that this won't end well, but a wonderful encounter might be lying in store...!::
18851::$$$message_0145_0001_0000$$$::"Good evening! Hello![lr]::
18852::$$$message_0145_0001_0001$$$::You're up damn late!"[rf]::
18853::$$$message_0145_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18854::$$$message_0145_0002_0001$$$::There she is.[lr]::
18855::$$$message_0145_0002_0002$$$::If you're still not sure who this is, then it might serve you to visit the ruins before sundown.::
18856::$$$message_0145_0003_0000$$$::"And here we are![lr]::
18857::$$$message_0145_0003_0001$$$::Behold, the Seventh Factor that will evolve humanity: Quiz Dojo, Advanced."::
18858::$$$message_0145_0004_0000$$$::"Tonight's prize is a hot spring bath![lr]::
18859::$$$message_0145_0004_0001$$$::No more cramped fiberglass bathtubs! This is a heartwarming gift that'll let you stretch your legs![lr]::
18860::$$$message_0145_0004_0002$$$::By the way, you can choose from a bunch of different benefits, such as improved metabolism, household safety, or prosperity via mobile bomber fairy."::
18861::$$$message_0145_0005_0000$$$::"Oooh, sounds sketchy."[lr]::
18862::$$$message_0145_0005_0001$$$::I clap.[lr]::
18863::$$$message_0145_0005_0002$$$::Hot spring bath, my ass. The best this Quiz Fiend can do is remodel my bathroom, probably.[lr]::
18864::$$$message_0145_0005_0003$$$::"Hot spring" sure has a nice ring to it, though.[lr]::
18865::$$$message_0145_0005_0004$$$::Her sheer pluck was enough to earn a round of applause from me.::
18866::$$$message_0145_0006_0000$$$::"Hrm! Blessings be upon you, faithful one. There's plenty of happy, embarrassing events in store if you answer every question correctly.[lr]::
18867::$$$message_0145_0006_0001$$$::Baths are the heart of Japan.[lr]::
18868::$$$message_0145_0006_0002$$$::Baths are naked and sexy.[lr]::
18869::$$$message_0145_0006_0003$$$::When you accidentally go in when a girl's already inside, things get wild, woohoo!"::
18870::$$$message_0145_0007_0000$$$::"But such a utopia can't be allowed to exist![lr]::
18871::$$$message_0145_0007_0001$$$::Let the final battle begin![lr]::
18872::$$$message_0145_0007_0002$$$::You there, pervy kappa! If you want to live a normal life, just try and beat me!"::

